            </TextRuns>
            <Style />
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>出行人姓名：</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>=Parameters!TrallerPeople.Value</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0.03175cm</RightIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>紧急联系人：           手机：           　</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0.03175cm</RightIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>特别说明：</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0.03175cm</RightIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>1. 当地导游可以视当地实际情况更改行程及用餐地点，如无特殊情况以不减少行程表上景点为准！如遇不可抗拒因素，我公司和地接旅行社有权改变或缩短行程。团队旅游原则安排同性2人一间房，如出现单男单女，请团员务必配合轮流拆夫妻；遇单数团，多出一人以加床为准。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>2. </Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>特别说明：所有参加色情项目的，均由本人负责</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>3.　团员需根据当地导游和司机的服务态度及质量，</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>全程的小费为</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>     元/</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>人</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>4. 请在出团前自行前往相关银行兑换所需外币。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>我公司提醒各位参团游客，私自兑换外币属违法行为，请游客不要私自与黄牛兑换外币</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>。由此引起的纠纷，本公司不承担责任。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>5. 海关：自05年7月1日起，出境购物超过人民币5000元入境须交税。【进出境无论是否有申报物品，都必须填写旅客行李物品申报单，向海关如实申报】</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>6. 出入境：详见《中华人民共和国公民出境入境管理法》及《实施细则》。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>7. 由于各国的法律法规各不相同，请游客在出行前详细了解前往国或地区的法律法规，并在团队游览期间自觉遵守，以免造成不必要的麻烦与纠纷。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>8. 根据国家旅游局规定，我社已投保“旅行社责任保险”，</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>参加欧洲旅游团队，但是签证自理的游客可根据自身需要，自愿购买旅游个人人身意外保险（我社建议购买，游客已知晓）</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>。在旅行中，</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>凡因游客自身疾病或个人过错导致人身意外、财产损失均不属责任险条款中理赔范围</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>9. 团员在境外如遭遇“法轮功”，应听从领队安排，（1）不要有好奇心（2）不接受“法轮功”宣传品（3）不单独与“法轮功”发生直接冲突（4）接受当地我驻外使领馆的领导。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>10.　在旅游行程中，境外接待社、导游、领队如有违纪行为，欢迎游客投诉和举报。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>投诉处理按《旅行社质量保证金赔偿试行标准》办理。投诉请提供书面材料、发票、合同、团号、联系人及电话等</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>，投诉电话：021-61819891,传真：021-61819886</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <HangingIndent>-18pt</HangingIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>11. 自07年5月1日开始，乘坐从我国境内机场始发的国际、地区航班的旅客，随身携带的液态物品每件容积不能超过100毫升。盛放液态物品的容器，应放在最大容积不超过1升的、可重复封口的透明塑料袋中。每名旅客每次仅允许携带一个透明塑料袋，超出部分应托运。盛装液态物品的透明塑料袋须单独接受安全检查。</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>12.　凡参加本公司的游客，均视已认可上述说明.</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>宋体</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>9pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                  <Color>#000000</Color>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <LeftIndent>0cm</LeftIndent>
            <RightIndent>0cm</RightIndent>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
        </Paragraphs>
